## Errors

anytero-error-missing-anytype-api-key = Not authorized with Anytype. Please connect to Anytype in Anytero preferences.
anytero-error-anytype-auth-start-failed = Failed to start Anytype authentication. Please ensure Anytype desktop app is running.
anytero-error-anytype-no-auth-session = No active Anytype authentication session. Please try connecting again.
anytero-error-anytype-auth-complete-failed = Failed to complete Anytype authentication. Please check your code and try again.
anytero-error-anytype-create-failed = Failed to create Anytype object. Please check your connection and try again.
anytero-error-anytype-create-collection-failed = Failed to create library collection in Anytype. Please check your connection and try again.
anytero-error-anytype-update-failed = Failed to update Anytype object. Please check your connection and try again.
anytero-error-missing-pref = Missing value for { $pref }. Please enter it in Anytero preferences.
